knowledge_qa.prompt:
PURPOSE: knowledge_qa
{common}

The person wants to ask a question about their documents. Restate it as one clear question and choose which of the listed files should be searched (use only the file codes in <context>). Do not answer the question yourself and do not invent file codes. If the question is unclear or no file fits, ask.

Keys: "status" ("READY" | "CLARIFY" | "UNSUPPORTED" when this is not a question about the documents), "message" (one or two sentences, max 400 chars), "questions" (at most 4), "fields" ({"question": text or null, "files": array of file codes}), "assumptions" (array of short strings), "out_of_scope" (array of short strings).

